2d6ae9e2-4747-4c0e-9d8c-e7a4c290d681	Script for drama: Be satisfied with what you have.	I have recently read a book written by Matt Haig. \nThe story of the book is like there is one girl with whom everything is going wrong in life and she commits suicide but instead of dying she reaches a library where she is offered to try numerous chances to undo the wrong decisions which she had taken due to which her life was bad. \n\nAfter experiencing numerous life she comes to conclusion that what she had in her life was far superior then what she experienced in other life even if it meant that she would have to struggle. \n\nMoral : Be happy with what you have. In event of chasing things which you dont you might end losing which you have.	\N	117f2d44-cb82-475c-bdf9-841f771649d5	reviewed	\N	2026-05-03 15:04:58.714203+00	2026-06-02 18:51:48.234+00
