c3d175f3-dd6e-4000-bd32-ebe20b589705	PRJ-002	Veer Vanshaj: Self Defence Workshop	The Veer Vanshaj - Self Defence Workshop empowers individuals, especially women, with the skills and confidence to protect themselves in any situation. The initiative offers practical self-defence training, focusing on building physical strength, awareness, and mental resilience. Launched with the aim of ensuring safety and independence, the workshops have already gained momentum with multiple successful sessions. Our future vision includes expanding this impactful program across Mumbai, reaching more individuals in need of self-defence training.	https://pdcgcqsgzupoyzklvoju.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/project-banners/0.8871190093364836.jpeg	f51b0111-f04d-453a-b6c0-60d9832fba6b	2026-02-01 15:45:33.519938+00	2026-02-01 15:45:33.519938+00	upcoming	public	30th Sept – 11th Oct 2026	t	\N	\N	\N	{}	f
e371d3f0-7356-4f5b-8616-300df65bfea7	PRJ-005	Sanskaar Library	The Sanskaar Library is an initiative designed to nurture reading habits and instill moral values in children through curated books. By creating a rotating library system that promotes morals, ethics, principles of Jainism and personal growth, we aim to build a foundation of knowledge and integrity among the younger generation.	https://pdcgcqsgzupoyzklvoju.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/project-banners/0.4307583412898245.jpeg	e243534f-6a49-436d-b637-a050b1e32de0	2026-02-02 12:46:26.885341+00	2026-02-02 12:46:26.885341+00	active	public		f	\N	\N	\N	{}	f
9d2e0a72-e048-4e6d-90ab-7930a459f941	PRJ-006	IT & Tech	Developing and improving our official website into a comprehensive repository of Jain teachings, principles, stories, blogs, articles, and literature. Volunteers contribute by enhancing structure, usability, and content presentation to ensure all resources are available in one accessible digital space.	https://pdcgcqsgzupoyzklvoju.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/project-banners/0.9836200471240258.jpg	7da7baeb-2615-4949-bc8c-5e10a3ea5ffd	2026-02-08 14:19:08.079624+00	2026-02-08 14:19:08.079624+00	active	private		f	\N	\N	\N	{}	f
