e65d8362-e612-4217-b769-cf74719c8d5a	PRJ-008-02	Reflect: Look Beyond your Version	Shri Riddhi Siddhi Adarsh Shwetambar Murtipujak Jain Sangh, Marve Road, Malad (West) and I ❤️ Jinshasan presents Reflect: Look Beyond your Version		b8f6d90e-b692-4a8a-8cbc-17909331fa73	2026-06-03 14:43:27.258239+00	2026-06-03 14:43:27.258239+00	completed	public	August 2026	t	7b25f17b-43dc-431b-bd80-2a0033602e75	\N	\N	{b8f6d90e-b692-4a8a-8cbc-17909331fa73}	f
134f3fc8-8546-4bb3-b39a-e671bfcb0808	PRJ-003	Jainific	Jainific is an innovative exhibition designed to explore the intersection of ancient Jain principles and modern science. The exhibition features interactive models, charts, and experiments that demonstrate the compatibility of Jain teachings with scientific concepts.	https://pdcgcqsgzupoyzklvoju.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/project-banners/0.05016668586183837.jpeg	b8f6d90e-b692-4a8a-8cbc-17909331fa73	2026-02-01 15:57:18.403327+00	2026-02-01 15:57:18.403327+00	upcoming	public	1st November 2026 | 11 AM to 8 PM	f	\N	\N	\N	{7da7baeb-2615-4949-bc8c-5e10a3ea5ffd}	f
44528d4e-5308-46ba-aefe-275f5fd1dc71	PRJ-007	Admin work	Admin work not related to any particular project.		a59d9b96-eccd-4b3a-a15f-ad6f693013a7	2026-02-08 12:29:24.547887+00	2026-02-08 12:29:24.547887+00	active	private		f	\N	\N	\N	{}	f
1ba3dd33-5e3b-43b0-a272-a1a978804d39	PRJ-009	KIVA	The name KIVA finds its roots in Prakrit, meaning कृपा (blessings). This initiative is built on the belief that by selflessly tending to the needs of animals, we receive their silent, powerful blessings in return.\n\nKIVA invites everyone to dedicate one weekend to mindful service in our partnered Panjrapols (animal sanctuaries) to engage in ground-level care, from feeding and grooming to assisting in the maintenance of the sanctuary.\n\nJoin us for two days of labor and love. Step away from the hustle of daily life and earn the "Kiva" of animals who have nowhere else to go.	https://pdcgcqsgzupoyzklvoju.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/project-banners/0.7953297959784796.jpeg	11fc3990-68cc-4cdb-ad83-fca0ec15799f	2026-05-06 16:29:49.183746+00	2026-05-06 16:29:49.183746+00	upcoming	public		f	\N	\N	\N	{}	f
