1736f19b-b817-4bc5-888b-a412f464e03a	PRJ-004	Knowledge and Blogs	Writing content for blogs on Jainism and related topics. These blogs are published on our website ilovejinshasan.org	https://pdcgcqsgzupoyzklvoju.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/project-banners/0.08290226501735143.jpeg	\N	2026-02-01 16:11:09.638868+00	2026-02-01 16:11:09.638868+00	active	public		f	\N	\N	\N	{117f2d44-cb82-475c-bdf9-841f771649d5,232f55ca-9598-4daf-a8ef-5e9be124c975}	f
644691e8-6498-4d89-a46b-3f0184c94dc1	PRJ-008-01	Reconnect: with Soul, Shasan and Nature	Unplug from the digital world and ground yourself in what matters. Reconnect offers a unique space to explore the harmony between your Soul, our Shasan, and the beauty of Nature. Join us to refresh your spirit and find your center.	https://pdcgcqsgzupoyzklvoju.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/project-banners/0.009730189570724579.jpeg	\N	2026-05-14 14:46:44.348065+00	2026-05-14 14:46:44.348065+00	upcoming	public	5 - 7 November 2026	t	7b25f17b-43dc-431b-bd80-2a0033602e75	https://example.com/register	https://example.com/qna	{}	f
8cb7137b-6d45-494b-afaa-b6e8019305c3	PRJ-010	REVA - Experience the Divine	REVA is a weekly devotional initiative designed to help you detach from the world’s noise. Experience devotion in its purest form, led by the ethereal and meditative vibrations of a handpan. With no loud instruments or distractions, we leave the chaos of the world behind to reconnect with our inner self and the Divine. Our venue changes every week to keep the experience intimate. Stay tuned for our next location as we invite you to join us, pause for a moment, and find your stillness.	https://pdcgcqsgzupoyzklvoju.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/project-banners/0.18227134542660983.png	3b54e716-c5a0-4d4c-a616-4e2e2be95539	2026-05-07 17:19:56.834639+00	2026-05-07 17:19:56.834639+00	upcoming	public		f	\N	\N	\N	{}	f
deed7a1e-10f7-4f6a-906a-aac54bb1f619	PRJ-001	Digital Jinshasan	Spreading the timeless wisdom of Jainism through modern channels. Our Promotion of Jainism on Social Media, primarily through the Instagram page @ilovejinshasan, seeks to inspire a global audience by highlighting the profound values and principles of Jain philosophy. Through engaging content  we aim to promote awareness and foster a deeper connection to Jainism. Our social media presence is steadily growing, empowering individuals to embrace teachings of Jainism in everyday life.	https://pdcgcqsgzupoyzklvoju.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/project-banners/0.7966996394579555.jpeg	0c6384b4-15bd-42b1-a978-317e1d163f8d	2026-02-01 15:26:54.23616+00	2026-02-01 15:26:54.23616+00	active	public		f	\N	\N	\N	{}	f
7b25f17b-43dc-431b-bd80-2a0033602e75	PRJ-008	Spiritual Workshop	Our Workshops (spiritual retreats) are designed as immersive experiences to help you pause, reflect, and realign with your inner values. Moving beyond theoretical knowledge, these retreats focus on the practical application of ancient wisdom in our fast-paced, modern lives.\nWhether it is a single-day Sunday gathering or a multi-day intensive, each Workshop is crafted to be interactive, relatable, and deeply impactful. We combine traditional teachings with contemporary insights, ensuring the experience is accessible to today’s youth while staying rooted in core philosophical principles.	https://pdcgcqsgzupoyzklvoju.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/project-banners/0.8749523258806222.jpeg	b8f6d90e-b692-4a8a-8cbc-17909331fa73	2026-04-12 11:16:58.734146+00	2026-04-12 11:16:58.734146+00	upcoming	public	5th Nov, 2026 to 7th Nov, 2026	t	\N	\N	\N	{b8f6d90e-b692-4a8a-8cbc-17909331fa73}	f
