012dc168-c8d8-427e-b347-b7d338887409	Ankit Shah	7666894355	35	Male	Dombivali East	Acquaintance	\N	Kumud ben Hitesh bhai Gutka	9833357780	51	Prabha devi , mumbai	Married	\N	Hitesh bhai gutka	\N	{"Religious Events / Aayojan","Other (Please Specify)"}	Tiffin service to all senior citizens	\N	\N	5–10 years	10–20 hours per week	\N	Kumud Ben, along with her husband, is doing truly great seva for senior citizens, that too completely on their own.\n>\n> Earlier, they used to take senior citizens for a one-day Jatra, where everything was managed and financed by themselves.\n>\n> After that, they started a tiffin service for senior citizens. Today, they are giving *1100+ tiffins daily* to senior citizens across Mumbai.\n>\n> For this, they have set up their own kitchen in every location, be it Central Line, Western Line or Harbour Line. The person who cooks at that location has the responsibility of delivering the tiffin to the allocated senior citizens.\n>\n> And the most inspiring part is, all this is done with their own money. They do not charge anything to the senior citizens, it is completely free. They do not even take any donations from anyone.\n>\n> Apart from this, they have now started sending senior citizens on a *3 Nights / 4 Days package to Mahabaleshwar - Panchgani*. They book a room in a hotel or dharamshala, arrange a private car for pick-up and drop, and also for sightseeing. This is also completely free of charge for senior citizens.\n>\n> Such selfless seva without any expectation is truly rare. Kumud Ben and her husband are an inspiration for all of us.\n>\n> Let us all appreciate and salute their great work. 🙏❤️	\N	\N	\N	t	t	submitted	\N	2026-11-04 02:02:22.207886+00
\.
